cocos/build-configs/

# Hunyuan world-rebuild raw outputs: judged offline references, too large for git.
# See cocos/docs/V13.1_HUNYUAN3D_PIPELINE.md — the collider mesh is a Poisson shell,
# the splats cannot be rendered by Cocos 3.8.3, and the 32 MB source PNG is the only
# full-resolution master (the 5120 JPEG beside it is the committed copy).
art-source/references/hunyuan-output/*.ply
art-source/references/hunyuan-output/hunyuan-world-panorama-7680x3840.png
